      "image": "assets/images/25160/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook corn in boiling water for 7 to 10 minutes, or until desired tenderness. Drain, cool, and cut kernels off the cob with a sharp knife.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/37G5YUOr3xLI6jvIQPO_E55N1dA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25160-Summer-Corn-Salad-DDMFS-Step-02-17189-b1ffc5743bda4adc8cb6004519b2cdc1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25160/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine corn, tomatoes, onion, and basil in a large bowl. Whisk together olive oil and vinegar; season with salt and pepper. Pour vinaigrette over corn mixture and toss to coat. Cover and refrigerate until ready to serve.",
